[h1]Reclaim the Motherland / 重整河山[/h1]

[b]The Mandate may be lost. The dynasty need not vanish with it.[/b]
[b]天命可以失去，王朝不必随之湮灭。[/b]

0.4.0 · CK3 1.19.0.6 · All Under Heaven required

[h1]A New Default Rule / 新增默认规则[/h1]

“Fate of the Chinese Hegemon” defaults to “Reclaim the Motherland”; “Vanilla Shattering” restores vanilla behavior. “The Choice of the Loyalists” defaults to “Divided Hearts,” with “Unwavering Loyalty” retaining every Pro-Hegemon vassal.
【中华霸权统治者的命运】默认【重整河山】，也可恢复【群雄割据（原版）】；【尊王诸侯的抉择】默认【人心离散】，也可选择尊王派全员留下的【誓死尊王】。

[h1]When All Under Heaven Fractures / 群雄割据之时[/h1]

[list]
[*]The old ruler loses the Chinese Hegemony, but keeps every personally held domain and unrelated title. / 旧天子失去中华霸权，但进入群雄割据前亲自持有的领地与其他个人头衔仍归本人。
[*]A new empty-de-jure Hegemony is created as “Later + old dynasty name”: for example, Later Song / 后宋. / 创建空法理的“后＋原朝号”霸权，例如【后宋】。
[*]Pro-Hegemon lords decide once: enemies may rebel, close bonds may remain, and uncertain lords weigh opinion, character, rank, military strength, legitimacy, and dread. / 尊王诸侯会在裂解一刻抉择：仇敌可叛、深交可留，其余人权衡好感、性情、地位、军力、合法性与威慑。
[*]A lord who finally remains keeps the same primary title, displayed or custom realm name, direct liege, and complete subordinate realm tree. “Qingxu Circuit” will not be arbitrarily renamed during the shattering. / 最终留下的忠臣保留原主头衔、显示或自定义国号、直属关系与完整下级封臣树；【青徐路】不会再因群雄割据被随意换号。
[*]Defectors and every other direct vassal break away and continue through vanilla Chaos reorganization. / 反叛的尊王诸侯与其他直属封臣脱离，并继续按原版群雄割据逻辑重组。
[/list]

[h1]The Later Dynasty and Its Court / 后朝与旧朝廷[/h1]

[list]
[*]The empty-de-jure Later Hegemony now has a primary heir; existing Later titles gain the contract on load. / 空法理后朝霸权现具有主继承人；旧版既有后朝会在加载时补齐合同。
[*]On the former emperor's death, the same Later title and loyalist realm pass to that heir; other personal titles keep their normal succession. / 旧君驾崩后，同一后朝头衔与忠臣封臣树由主继承人接续；其他个人头衔仍按原规则继承。
[*]The nine ministries continue under the latest Later Dynasty. Eligible loyal incumbents stay; defectors leave office; real vacancies use vanilla appointment. / 最近失去天命的后朝延续三省六部九席：合资格的留朝旧臣原位留任，叛离者离任，真实空缺交回原版任免。
[*]This does not preserve formal Grand Secretariat power-sharing, the Mandate, or reigning-Hegemony privileges. / 这不保留正式中书门下权力分享、天命或现任中华霸权专属特权。
[/list]

[h1]No Instant Diplomatic Reunification / 割据不再顷刻归附[/h1]

A Later Dynasty is no longer treated as the reigning Chinese Hegemony by Offer Vassalization and loses its rank-gap, Hegemony, and high-tier exemptions.
后朝在【提议附庸】中不再被误当成现任中华霸权，也不再获得天朝等级差、霸权身份及高阶诸侯豁免。

Direct vassals released by the shattering receive a title-bound, five-year “Recently Independent” memory: a visible -50 acceptance reason against that Later Dynasty. Ruler changes cannot bypass it; patient diplomacy remains possible after expiry.
本轮实际脱离的直属诸侯获得绑定主头衔、持续五年的【新近自立】记忆：面对该后朝的附庸提议显示 -50 接受度，双方换君不能绕过，期满后仍可外交统一。

[h1]Proclaim the Restoration / 宣称复辟[/h1]

A Later ruler cannot “Claim the Mandate.” During Chaos, controlling 51% of the Chinese Hegemony's de-jure counties, including qualifying tributary land, unlocks “Proclaim the Restoration.”
后朝持有者不能【宣称天命】；群雄割据期间控制中华霸权法理伯爵领的 51%（含合资格朝贡国）即可【宣称复辟】。

Restoration uses the same new-dynasty, warlord-submission, and Dynastic Cycle effects as Claim the Mandate, then retires the Later title.
【宣称复辟】沿用【宣称天命】的新朝、群雄归附与王朝循环效果，最后销毁后朝头衔。

[h1]0.4.0 更新记录[/h1]

[list]
[*]修复空法理后朝霸权在死亡结算中无法可靠传给主继承人的问题，并为旧版后朝存档增加幂等迁移。
[*]旧君驾崩后，后朝头衔与留朝忠臣封臣树继续由主继承人统领。
[*]后朝延续三省六部九席：留朝合资格的原班大臣不动，随割据者离朝的大臣离任，只补空缺。
[*]修正后朝被和平附庸公式误当成现任中华霸权的问题。
[*]本轮实际脱离的直属诸侯获得五年、绑定双方头衔且可见的【新近自立】-50 接受度。
[*]二期【人心离散】、忠臣国号与封臣树保护、51% 原版门槛及【宣称复辟】保持不变。
[/list]

