[h1]Verification / 验收[/h1]

Reproducible 35-file build. MCP-first CK3 1.19.0.6 acceptance covers shattering, loyalist continuity, real-death succession, all nine ministers, two real vassalization refusals, five-year expiry, the 51% threshold, and restoration.
可复现的 35 文件构建；MCP-first CK3 1.19.0.6 验收覆盖裂解、忠臣延续、真实死亡继承、九席大臣、两次真实附庸拒绝、五年到期、51% 门槛与复辟。

[h1]Localization / 本地化[/h1]

English / 简体中文 / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español

[h1]Compatibility / 兼容性[/h1]

Requires CK3 1.19.0.6 and All Under Heaven; new single-player games recommended. Old Later titles gain succession migration, but “Recently Independent” applies only to new shatterings. Human loyalists use the public 50-point boundary. Overrides [code]tgp_chaos_shattering_effect[/code], [code]situation_dynastic_cycle_claim_mandate_decision[/code], [code]tgp_has_access_to_ministry_trigger[/code], and [code]offer_vassalization_interaction[/code].
需要 CK3 1.19.0.6 与《溥天之下 / All Under Heaven》，推荐新开单人存档。旧后朝会获得继承迁移，但【新近自立】只适用于更新后的新裂解；人类尊王诸侯使用公开的 50 分分界。本 mod 覆写上述四个原版 key，其他同类覆写可能产生加载顺序冲突。

